azers_count":88816,"watchers_count":88816,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":9808,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":2246,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["angular","components","design-systems","documentation","html","javascript","react","react-native","stories","storybook","styleguide","svelte","testing","typescript","ui","vite","vue","web-components","webpack","workshop"],"visibility":"public","forks":9808,"open_issues":2246,"watchers":88816,"default_branch":"next","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/pulls/22262","html_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/22262","diff_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/22262.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/22262.patch","merged_at":"2023-09-19T15:45:03Z"},"body":"Issue: #22199\r\n\r\n<!-- Thank you for contributing to Storybook! If your PR is related to an issue, provide the number(s) above; if it resolves multiple issues, be sure to break them up (e.g. \"closes #1000, closes #1001\"). -->\r\n\r\n## What I did\r\n- Currently, a tint of the default color.secondary in base.ts (code/lib/theming/src/base.ts) is used as background color in the bar, so changed to use theme.color.secondary as background color when BranchNode is hovered or focused.\r\n- The same applies to LeafNode\r\n\r\n<!-- Briefly describe what your PR does -->\r\n\r\n※ The reason why 0.93 is passed for the first argument of the transparentize function is because the value of background.hoverable in base.ts (code/lib/theming/src/base.ts) did so.\r\n\r\n| BranchNode(before)| BranchNode(after) |LeafNode(before) |LeafNode(after) |\r\n| :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\r\n| ![スクリーンショット 2023-04-26 23 18 57](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/57059705/234606019-7fc0dc0c-86b5-4866-99d6-eb490865e0cb.png)|<img width=\"212\" alt=\"スクリーンショット 2023-04-26 23 24 29\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/57059705/234606591-cdb6c945-0909-4615-bfc1-4ceb975693ac.png\"> |![スクリーンショット 2023-04-26 23 18 09](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/57059705/234605636-65514e95-f2ad-4b56-ac3e-9c5a9715a6c9.png) |<img width=\"213\" alt=\"スクリーンショット 2023-04-26 23 25 42\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/57059705/234607019-36cc4fee-5214-4c45-8540-91c12f965c24.png\"> |\r\n\r\n\r\n## How to test\r\n- generate a new theme using the create() function from storybook/theming as folows.\r\n```ts\r\n// code/ui/.storybook/manager.ts\r\nimport { addons } from '@storybook/manager-api';\r\nimport startCase from 'lodash/startCase.js';\r\nimport { create } from '@storybook/theming/create';\r\n\r\naddons.setConfig({\r\n  sidebar: {\r\n    renderLabel: ({ name, type }) => (type === 'story' ? name : startCase(name)),\r\n  },\r\n  theme: create({\r\n    base: 'light',\r\n    colorSecondary: '#FF8688',\r\n  }),\r\n});\r\n```\r\n- `cd code`\r\n- `yarn storybook:ui`\r\n- Check that the secondary-based color is used as background color when the BranchNode/LeafNode is hovered or focused.\r\n\r\n<!-- Please include the steps to test your changes here. For example:\r\n\r\n1. Run a sandbox for template, e.g. `yarn task --task sandbox --start-from auto --template react-vite/default-ts`\r\n2. Open Storybook in your browser\r\n3. Access X story\r\n\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n<!-- Please check (put an \"x\" inside the \"[ ]\") the applicable items below to make sure your PR is ready to be reviewed. -->\r\n\r\n- [ ] Make sure your changes are tested (stories and/or unit, integration, or end-to-end tests)\r\n- [ ] Make sure to add/update documentation regarding your changes\r\n- [ ] If you are deprecating/removing a feature, make sure to update\r\n      [MIGRATION.MD](https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/next/MIGRATION.md)\r\n\r\n#### Maintainers\r\n\r\n- [ ] If this PR should be tested against many or all sandboxes,\r\n      make sure to add the `ci:merged` or `ci:daily` GH label to it.\r\n- [ ] Make sure this PR contains **one** of the labels below.\r\n\r\n`[\"cleanup\", \"BREAKING CHANGE\", \"feature request\", \"bug\", \"documentation\", \"maintenance\", \"dependencies\", \"other\"]`\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n\r\nEverybody: Please submit all PRs to the `next` branch unless they are specific to the current release. Storybook maintainers cherry-pick bug and documentation fixes into the `main` branch as part of the release process, so you shouldn't need to worry about this. For additional guidance: https://storybook.js.org/docs/react/contribute/how-to-contribute\r\n\r\n-->\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/22262/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/22262/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/comments/1568243250","html_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/issues/22199#issuecomment-1568243250","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/22199","id":1568243250,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAzqfmc5deX4y","user":{"login":"artekkk","id":27737969,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NzM3OTY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27737969?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/artekkk","html_url":"https://github.com/artekkk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artekkk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artekkk/fo